---
layout: layouts/page.njk
pageKey: data
crumbKey: crumb.data
title: "Data and downloads — Citere"
description: "Download the Citere claim registry, per-run chatbot observations, the domain watchlist and the countermeasures log. CSV and JSON under CC BY 4.0."
schemas:
  - datacatalog
pagination:
  data: build.languages
  alias: lang
  size: 1
permalink: "{{ '/data/' | loc(lang) }}"
---
{%- for entity in datasets.entities %}
<h2 id="{{ entity.key }}" style="margin:30px 0 6px">{{ entity.name }}</h2>
<p class="note" style="margin:0 0 12px;max-width:78ch">{{ entity.blurb }}</p>
{%- set sample = samples[entity.key] %}
{%- if sample %}
<p class="note" style="margin:0 0 6px">Domains are printed defanged here, as everywhere on this site; the exported file carries them as they are.</p>
<details class="fdrop schema">
  <summary class="f">A real record from this table &#8964;</summary>
  <pre class="codebox"><code>{{ sample | dump(2) | defangCopy }}</code></pre>
</details>
{%- endif %}
{%- for file in entity.files %}
{%- if file.header %}
<details class="fdrop schema">
  <summary class="f">{{ file.name }} &mdash; columns &#8964;</summary>
  <pre class="codebox"><code>{{ file.header }}</code></pre>
</details>
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
<div class="exports" style="margin:10px 0 0">
  {%- for file in entity.files %}
  <a href="{{ file.url | url }}">{{ file.name }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}<span>&middot;</span>{% endif %}
  {%- endfor %}
</div>
<p class="note" style="margin:8px 0 0">{% for file in entity.files %}<b>{{ file.name }}</b> &mdash; {{ file.description }}{% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
{%- endfor %}

<h2 id="not-published" style="margin:30px 0 6px">What is not published</h2>
<p style="max-width:78ch">We do not publish the exact questions we send, the full text of chatbot answers,
  anything specific to the hostile (P4) prompt, the judge model's prompt and rubric, or the content and
  proof of each report we send to a platform. We publish the aggregated results; the raw material behind
  them stays internal. Researchers who need more can write to us.</p>

